+ This
    - box

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is FrameAnimation ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ do advance Bool
    - tick FrameTick

. state = box.scroll-state
=? false if !state
. fade = state.indicator-fade
=? false if !fade
fade.update(tick.now)
if !fade.is-moving
    state.indicator-fade = null
box.invalidate-scroll-paint()
= fade.is-moving

────────────────────
+ do finish

. state = box.scroll-state
=? if !state || !state.indicator-fade
state.indicator-fade = null
box.invalidate-scroll-paint()

